OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells through the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight but a few showers in the
OL,8,Fwest. Fresh to strong westerly winds
OL,9,Fwill start to ease through the early
OL,10,Fhours.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMostly dry and bright with
OL,13,Fgood sunny spells, but somewhat
OL,14,Fcloudier in the afternoon with the
OL,15,Fchance of the odd shower. Fresh winds
OL,16,Fat first will become light by
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
