OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fquite cloudy with some showers, also
OL,7,Fwindy. Sunny spells, a few showers
OL,8,FMonday, strengthening southwesterly
OL,9,Fwinds. Windy again Tuesday with
OL,10,Fshowers.
